==== CFE Web Recovery ====
Basically, this device has a built-in web interface that allows you to upload a firmware to recover the system over HTTP.
  - Set your PC's IP address to 192.168.0.2 and subnet mask to 255.255.255.0
  - Press and hold the reset button (behind) until the orange power indicator blinks constantly.
  - Navigate to http://192.168.0.1 and you should see a page which asks you to upload a file.
  - Upload an OpenWrt TRX file or stock firmware and wait for a success message
  - If web browser is constantly loading, restart from step 2.
